<http://data.silknow.org/object/4aea5338-6e6f-3ab7-9c75-1222c9be892b/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Man’s coat and breeches of dark beige silk satin, figured in a pattern of repeating  floral sprigs.  The coat is interlined with. It has a round neckline and narrow skirts below the waist. The side and centre back seams are open below the hip. There is a horizontal pocket low on each front, with a narrow flap fastened at each end with a wooden core button covered dark beige silk. Between these are 9 single lines of buttonhole stitch, and 9 buttons below the flap. Only 1 button remains on the left side. There are 45 buttonholes on the left front, and 45 dark beige silk buttons on the right front. There are 15 single lines of buttonhole stitch at the side and centre back openings with corresponding buttons; 30 remain.  The coat was originally lined with carnation pink silk taffeta; this and the sleeves are now missing.\n\nThe breeches are made of the same figured silk satin, interlined with linen and lined with dark beige silk taffeta. They are gathered at the waist, falling to above the knee and turning up with a pointed border, 9¼-inches (23.5 cm) at the deepest. There is a watch pocket of chamois on each side of the waistband and pocket openings on each front, with pocket bags of chamois lined with carnation silk. The watch pockets fasten with a buttonhole and button.  The breeches fasten with 2  silver filé buttons and buttonholes on the waistband front, an eyelet on each side of the waistband centre back, laced with ½-inch (1.3 cm) wide dark brown silk grosgrain ribbon. There is a buttonhole stand on the left with 4 worked buttonholes and 4 beige silk-covered buttons on the right. The pocket openings, centre front opening and button stand are bound with the beige grosgrain ribbon. The facings on the turned-up hems of the legs are now missing."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/4aea5338-6e6f-3ab7-9c75-1222c9be892b> .

